# Implementation plan — Spec 1.5.0

## Summary

Spec 1.5.0 delivers **view/edit modes** on the Identity `/profile` page (default view), **Media selector embed** for profile images at `/root/users/{userId}` with **locked 1:1 crop**, and **removes the WebOnOne media demo** route and nav link. Work spans **`identity/`** (profile UX + Media consumer), **`media/`** + **`packages/media-embed/`** (selector `cropAspectPresets`), and **`webonone-v2/`** (demo cleanup). See [01-overview.md](./01-overview.md), [02-identity-profile-page.md](./02-identity-profile-page.md), [03-webonone-cleanup.md](./03-webonone-cleanup.md).

## Branch and prerequisites

| Item | Value |
|------|--------|
| Branch | `spec/1.5.0` |
| Package builds | `npm run build:media-embed` before identity prod build |
| Migrations | None |
| Env | `identity/frontend/.env.example` — add `VITE_MEDIA_ORIGIN`; derive selector URL in `mediaConfig.ts` |
| JWT | `JWT_SECRET` in Identity + Media backends (unchanged) |

