## Phase 1 — Media selector locked crop

**Goal:** `cropAspectPresets` query param locks selector upload crop to allowed ratios.

**Exit criteria:** Selector with `cropAspectPresets=1:1` shows crop dialog without other ratio options.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Add `cropAspectPresets` to `BuildMediaSelectorUrlOptions` | `packages/media-embed/src/types.ts` |
| Append comma-separated param in builder | `packages/media-embed/src/embedUrl.ts` |
| Parse in embed mode | `media/frontend/src/features/media/hooks/useEmbedMode.ts` |
| Pass to `ImageCropDialog` | `media/frontend/src/features/media/pages/SelectorPage.tsx` |
| Hide ratio UI when single preset | `media/frontend/src/features/media/components/ImageCropDialog.tsx` |
| `MediaSelectorFrame` prop passthrough | `packages/media-embed/src/MediaSelectorFrame.tsx` |

**Verify:** `npm run build -w @webonone/media-embed`; `npm run type-check -w media-root`

---

## Phase 2 — Identity profile view/edit

**Goal:** View mode default; edit mode with avatar selector modal. See [02-identity-profile-page.md](./02-identity-profile-page.md).

**Exit criteria:** `/profile` view → edit → select image → save → view shows updated avatar.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| `mediaConfig.ts` | `identity/frontend/src/features/profile/utils/mediaConfig.ts` |
| Env example | `identity/frontend/.env.example` |
| `ProfileView` | `identity/frontend/src/features/profile/components/ProfileView.tsx` |
| `ProfileAvatarEditor` | `identity/frontend/src/features/profile/components/ProfileAvatarEditor.tsx` |
| `ProfileMediaSelectorModal` | `identity/frontend/src/features/profile/components/ProfileMediaSelectorModal.tsx` |
| Refactor `ProfileForm` — mode toggle, pending avatar | `identity/frontend/src/features/profile/components/ProfileForm.tsx` |
| Include `avatarUrl` in save payload | `identity/frontend/src/features/profile/schemas/profileSchemas.ts` |
| Add `@webonone/media-embed` dep + Vite alias | `identity/frontend/package.json`, `vite.config.ts` |
| Chain `build:media-embed` | `identity/package.json` |

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w identity-root`; manual `/profile` smoke with Media running

