## Phase 3 — WebOnOne media demo removal

**Goal:** Remove demo route and nav per [03-webonone-cleanup.md](./03-webonone-cleanup.md).

**Exit criteria:** No Media demo in nav; type-check passes.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Remove nav item | `webonone-v2/frontend/src/features/shell/config/navItems.ts` |
| Remove route | `webonone-v2/frontend/src/app/router.tsx` |
| Delete demo page + unused components | `features/media/pages/MediaDemoPage.tsx`, `MediaViewerEmbed.tsx`, `MediaUploadDialogModal.tsx`, `MediaSelectorModal.tsx` |

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w webonone-v2-root`

