## Cross-service integration

| Channel | Usage |
|---------|--------|
| **iframe** | Identity opens Media `/selector` with `parentOrigin`, `scope`, `folderPath` |
| **postMessage** | `sendMediaInit` (JWT); `webonone:media:select` returns selected item URL |
| **REST** | Identity `PATCH /me` with `avatarUrl` — no Media API calls from Identity BE |

Scope: `identity:user:{userId}`. Folder: `/root/users/{userId}`.

